---
/**
 * The Plausible tag, once, for every layout (landing#612).
 *
 * It used to be written into Layout.astro alone. DocsLayout and ApiLayout do not
 * render Layout, so the docs, the connector setup guides and the API section
 * loaded no analytics at all. Any layout that renders a <head> renders this.
 *
 * tests/analytics-every-page.test.ts reads dist/ and fails when a built page
 * carries no tag or carries two, and it reads the src and data-domain from this
 * file, so this is the only copy to change.
 */
---

<script is:inline defer data-domain="datanika.io" src="https://plausible.datanika.io/js/script.tagged-events.js"></script>
